Package: groupedChord
Title: Grouped Circular Flow Diagrams
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Aurélien", "Nicosia", email = "116816597+AurelienNicosiaULaval@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Create interactive bipartite circular flow diagrams with radial
    labels and an outer grouping ring. A common angular scale preserves
    link weights at both ends. Includes configurable colours, multiple widget
    instances, keyboard interaction, SVG export and Shiny bindings.
    Examples use entirely fictional workshop production data.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: htmlwidgets
Suggests: shiny, testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://aureliennicosiaulaval.github.io/groupedChord/,
    https://github.com/AurelienNicosiaULaval/groupedChord
BugReports: https://github.com/AurelienNicosiaULaval/groupedChord/issues
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
